# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Force apex -> www so the canonical URL matches the configured siteUrl.
https://geospatialannotation.com/*  https://www.geospatialannotation.com/:splat  301!

# Trailing-slash normalization is already produced by Eleventy (every URL ends in /).
# Catch-all 404 fallback (Pages serves /404.html automatically if present; the
# offline page is intentionally noindex and not used as 404).
